.TH AVR\-ORG\-SAML\-ENFORCEMENT 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-saml-enforcement \- Enable or disable mandatory SAML sign-in (admin only).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org saml enforcement
[OPTIONS] {on|off}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable or disable mandatory SAML sign-in (admin only).
.PP
Enabling requires a configured SAML connection and at least one verified company domain.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr org saml enforcement on
    avr org saml enforcement off --org acme
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fISTATE\fR
(choices: on, off)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-saml (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-configure (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-remove (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-show (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-sp-metadata (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-test (1)
